@startmindmap
' EKA-64 — MOD-WEB static crawler anchor delivery (base 4cc1193, T-504, mapping only)
* MOD-WEB: crawler anchor request to HTTP status
** Next config (apps/web/next.config.mjs)
*** gebaut: nextConfig.redirects (only /download/ekklesia-latest.apk)
*** gebaut: nextConfig.headers (Referrer-/Permissions-Policy, no status effect)
** Proxy (apps/web/src/proxy.ts)
*** gebaut: config.matcher excludes dotted paths (.*\\..*)
*** gebaut: proxy() — not invoked for /ai.txt, /llms-full.txt, /llms.txt
** Public bundle (apps/web/Dockerfile.prod)
*** gebaut: COPY docs/robots.txt docs/sitemap.xml docs/llms.txt ./public/
*** gebaut: runner COPY /app/public + .next/standalone
*** offen: ai.txt / llms-full.txt (no source file, not copied)
** App router locale segment
*** gebaut: src/app/[locale]/page.tsx::HomePage redirect("https://ekklesia.gr")
*** gebaut: src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx::LocaleLayout (no locale validation)
*** offen: invalid-locale notFound() guard (EKA-64 soft-404 cause)
** Regression test
*** gebaut: src/proxy.test.ts (download redirects, root rewrite)
*** offen: dotted single-segment miss -> 404 test
@endmindmap

